Output:
[18:55:26.051] INFO (#2): Listening on http://0.0.0.0:3000
[18:55:26.057] INFO (#12) http.span=2ms: Sent HTTP response { 'http.method': 'GET', 'http.url': '/', 'http.status': 200 }
Hello, World!
*/

